<title>UK: AHB sets 500 million mark two-year bond.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 500 million mark two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    27.AUG.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.935    PAY DATE    27.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	INHAERSCHULDVERSCHREIBUNG EMISSION 69</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
